# Database schema
Table Student, columns = [*, StuID, LName, Fname, Age, Sex, Major, Advisor, city_code]
Table Has_Pet, columns = [*, StuID, PetID]
Table Pets, columns = [*, PetID, PetType, pet_age, weight]

Foreign_keys = [Has_Pet.StuID = Student.StuID, Has_Pet.PetID = Pets.PetID]

# Question
Find the first name and gender of student who have more than one pet.

# Schema links
Schema_links: [Student.Fname, Student.Sex, Student.StuID, Has_Pet.StuID, Has_Pet.PetID]

# SQL


正在调用 DeepSeek：SQL Generation……

模型生成的 SQL：
SELECT Student.Fname, Student.Sex
FROM Student
JOIN Has_Pet ON Student.StuID = Has_Pet.StuID
GROUP BY Student.StuID, Student.Fname, Student.Sex
HAVING COUNT(Has_Pet.PetID) > 1;

Gold SQL（仅用于核对）：
SELECT T1.fname ,  T1.sex FROM student AS T1 JOIN has_pet AS T2 ON T1.stuid  =  T2.stuid GROUP BY T1.stuid HAVING count(*)  >  1

